## 🐛 What's New in v1.3

### Bug Fixes
✅ Fixed version inconsistency (v1.1 vs v1.2) in TTY mode  
✅ Implemented actual `--quiet` mode (was parsed but unused)  
✅ Fixed CPU_M/GPU_M never using fallback values  
✅ Fixed OS Age calculation on systems without inode birth-time  
✅ Removed phantom dependencies (bc, free) from docs  
✅ Fixed WM/terminal detection (no longer hardcoded)  
✅ Removed false "set -e" claim from CHANGELOG  

### Improvements
⚡ Intelligent caching for disk/sensors/battery (5-10 sec TTL)  
⚡ Bash expansion instead of subshells (micro-optimization)  
⚡ Real auto-detection of WM + terminal emulator  
⚡ Better error messages & early validation  
⚡ SPDX license header for compliance  

### Features
✨ Functional `--quiet` mode for dashboards  
✨ `set -uo pipefail` for safety  
✨ Single version constant (no more drift)  

[See full CHANGELOG](./CHANGELOG_v1.3.md)

